  "body": "I.e. instead of\r\n\r\n```html\r\n|options|' {{CookieStoreDeleteOptions/name}} dictionary member\r\n```\r\n\r\nyou can do\r\n\r\n```html\r\n|options|[\"{{CookieStoreDeleteOptions/name}}\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nBoth are fine, but the latter is a bit more pleasant to read.\r\n\r\nI only mention this because @inexorabletash seems to find making these sorts of changes relaxing :)",
